@startuml
title Погашение купона по QR/PIN
actor "Кассир" as Cashier
participant "Partner SPA" as SPA
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "order-service" as Order
participant "identity-service" as Identity
database "topdim_order" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "coupon-service" as Coupon
Cashier -> SPA: Сканирует QR / вводит PIN
SPA -> Gateway: POST /partner/redemptions[/qr]\nBearer JWT
Gateway -> Order: trusted X-User-* headers
Order -> Identity: GET internal partner access
Identity --> Order: merchant/location/staff context
Order -> DB: lock and validate ACTIVE/owner/expiry
Order -> DB: status=USED + redemption
Order -> MQ: coupon.redeemed
MQ -> Coupon: consume event
Coupon -> Coupon: idempotent redemption ledger/statistics
Order --> SPA: redemption response
@enduml
